<ol class="HELM_parts">
    <li>
        \(y = \dfrac{{@a1@}+x}{1-{@a1@}x}\), \(x =\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]
    </li>
    <li>
        \(y = \sqrt{\dfrac{x-{@a2@}}{x+1}}\), \(x =\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]
    </li>
</ol>
]]></text>
